#%PAM-1.0
# The session lock's fingerprint (doc_lock_and_prompts.md, LP8, LP9, D28), run by
# athanor-unlockd: no reader and no enrolled finger end the stack uncounted (die); a finger
# that does not match counts toward the lockout.
auth     requisite  pam_faillock.so preauth silent
auth     [success=done authinfo_unavail=die user_unknown=die default=bad]  pam_fprintd.so
auth     required   pam_faillock.so authfail
auth     required   pam_deny.so
account  include    system-auth
